    "reason": "Dropout prevents overfitting by randomly deactivating neurons, but this is a sufficient condition for the mechanism, not a necessary one. Other methods (e.g., early stopping, data augmentation) also prevent overfitting without random deactivation. The assertion implies dropout is the sole or primary method via random deactivation, ignoring alternative implementations that achieve the same property",
